{"id":"souffrance","lemma":"souffrance","pos":"noun","rank":2121,"glosses":["sufferance, pain, suffering"],"ipa":"/su.fʁɑ̃s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a9/Fr-souffrance.ogg/Fr-souffrance.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"souffrances"},"formAudio":{"souffrances":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b5/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-souffrances.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Encore combien de souffrance peuvent-ils endurer ?","en":"How much more suffering can they endure?","words":[{"g":"still"},{"g":"how much"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"they"},{"g":"to endure, to bear"}]},{"text":"La souffrance est la destinée des hommes.","en":"It is man's destiny to suffer.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"destiny, fate"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"man","l":"homme"}]},{"text":"La souffrance était atroce.","en":"The pain was excruciating.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"atrocious"}]},{"text":"Pourquoi la vie est-elle si remplie de souffrance ?","en":"Why is life so full of suffering?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"life"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"filled","l":"rempli"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Les deux poèmes expriment la souffrance humaine.","en":"The two poems express human suffering.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"two"},{"g":"poem","l":"poème"},{"g":"to express","l":"exprimer"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"human","l":"humain"}]}]}